                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
                      <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"><strong>Config passes cleanly</strong></td><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">The clean path through all four phases</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"><strong>Block beats pass</strong></td><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">66%+ YES still fails if NO reaches 25%</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"><strong>Meta change</strong></td><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">75% threshold, 30-day comment, 72h delay</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"><strong>Code proposal</strong></td><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">PR appears, human reviews, SHA recorded</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"><strong>Bench + reconsider</strong></td><td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">72h pause, deadline extension, then reconsider reverses</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="p-3"><strong>No quorum</strong></td><td class="p-3">40 eligible, 8 votes — floor of 10 fails</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
